# MealKit table (SpriteClip). Edit it in the editor's [Tables] panel. Row id = clip name; frames are cells of the sheet counted from the top left.
# hero_idle and hero_run are played by view/Draw.cpp drawWorld for the characters (textures/hero.png, made by tools/make_empty2d_art.py).
@format table 1

row hero_idle
image textures/hero.png
columns 4
rows 2
firstCell 0
frames 4
fps 3

row hero_run
image textures/hero.png
columns 4
rows 2
firstCell 4
frames 4
fps 10
